WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 9=

01:08.799 --> 01:09.680
Impudent!

01:09.760 --> 01:11.200
How dare you curse me?

01:11.519 --> 01:13.439
Guards, take this person of ill omen...

01:13.439 --> 01:13.920
Guards,

01:15.079 --> 01:16.879
send Shen Zhinian to the Cold Palace.

01:19.879 --> 01:20.719
Your Majesty,

01:21.159 --> 01:22.920
are you trying to protect her?

01:23.359 --> 01:25.280
I am venting your frustrations,
Dowager Consort.

01:27.799 --> 01:29.640
Liu Ruyan behaved
improperly before the throne.

01:30.120 --> 01:32.750
She will be demoted to Senior Attendant
and confined for one month.

01:32.840 --> 01:33.560
Enough.

01:36.900 --> 01:39.540
(Cold Palace)

01:45.719 --> 01:47.120
Young Lady,

01:47.799 --> 01:49.560
how can anyone live
in this broken place?

01:50.400 --> 01:51.000
It's fine.

01:51.680 --> 01:53.799
Tinglan Palace wasn't
much bigger than this.

01:54.439 --> 01:55.599
We'll clean it up in a bit.

01:55.720 --> 01:57.439
The more others try
to make us miserable,

01:57.640 --> 01:59.159
the more we should live happily.

01:59.380 --> 02:01.200
Only you would be so broad-minded,
Young Lady.

02:01.439 --> 02:03.920
His Majesty treated you like this,
yet you can still laugh?

02:04.120 --> 02:05.560
If I hadn't entered the Cold Palace,

02:05.719 --> 02:07.920
I would have lost my life long ago.

02:08.639 --> 02:11.319
We actually have to thank His Majesty.

02:11.919 --> 02:14.520
But being sent to
the Cold Palace is so heartless.

02:15.260 --> 02:16.960
His Majesty is
a suspicious man by nature.

02:16.960 --> 02:18.879
I deliberately
approached him in the palace,

02:19.000 --> 02:21.960
and my sister deliberately approached
the Dowager Consort at Mount Nanhua.

02:22.479 --> 02:24.560
How could he not suspect the two of us?

02:24.919 --> 02:27.240
But if His Majesty remains suspicious,

02:27.400 --> 02:29.439
will we never be able to get out?

02:29.439 --> 02:31.120
We've been through much worse than this.

02:31.520 --> 02:32.800
We'll deal with whatever

02:33.240 --> 02:34.360
comes our way.

02:37.140 --> 02:43.060
(Cold Palace)

03:00.479 --> 03:02.039
You scoundrel.

03:02.520 --> 03:04.080
Get out.

03:05.840 --> 03:06.800
What?

03:09.680 --> 03:11.400
You scoundrel.

03:11.800 --> 03:13.360
Get out.

03:16.080 --> 03:17.039
Shen Zhinian,

03:17.039 --> 03:17.919
how dare you hit me...

03:19.520 --> 03:21.639
A person without shame

03:22.159 --> 03:24.319
deserves to be punished.

03:24.560 --> 03:25.599
You were faking sleep.

03:27.319 --> 03:28.479
Mother...

03:29.280 --> 03:30.719
Nian...

03:32.159 --> 03:33.120
Remember this.

03:33.360 --> 03:34.639
In this world,

03:35.199 --> 03:37.319
- paths are never paved for the weak.
- Mother.

03:37.680 --> 03:39.879
You must strive to
grow to the highest point.

03:40.159 --> 03:41.280
Mother.

03:41.360 --> 03:42.240
The time has come.

03:42.520 --> 03:43.400
Drown her.

03:53.439 --> 03:54.639
Let's leave a mark.

03:55.479 --> 03:57.000
In the next life,

03:57.319 --> 03:59.080
you will be my child.

04:13.540 --> 04:17.420
(Fengqi Palace)

04:24.959 --> 04:26.279
I

04:26.279 --> 04:27.720
pay my respects to the Empress.

04:28.000 --> 04:30.920
Long live the Empress.

04:31.279 --> 04:32.120
Rise.

04:32.399 --> 04:33.680
Thank you, Your Highness.

04:34.560 --> 04:35.800
Be seated.

04:41.639 --> 04:43.920
I wonder why Your Majesty summoned me

04:43.920 --> 04:45.120
and what your instructions are.

04:46.480 --> 04:48.480
Senior Attendant Rou
committed no great fault.

04:49.160 --> 04:50.360
You are her sister.

04:50.839 --> 04:53.000
Why don't you plead for mercy
from the Dowager Consort?

04:55.639 --> 04:57.160
Please listen, Your Highness.

04:57.439 --> 04:58.560
The Immortal Peach Tree

04:58.560 --> 05:00.199
is the immortal tree of Mount Nanhua.

05:00.319 --> 05:01.920
It withered due to my sister.

05:02.959 --> 05:04.879
I was terrified in my heart.

05:05.120 --> 05:06.319
I dared not plead for mercy.

05:06.879 --> 05:09.160
I only hope the heavens' anger
will soon be appeased

05:09.839 --> 05:11.319
to protect the fate of Daliang.

05:12.839 --> 05:13.720
Alright.

05:15.000 --> 05:15.839
You may leave.

05:16.480 --> 05:18.079
Thank you, Your Highness.

05:25.639 --> 05:27.959
It seems the relationship
between these two sisters

05:27.959 --> 05:29.240
is really not harmonious.

05:33.480 --> 05:34.480
Has His Majesty

05:34.480 --> 05:35.600
visited the Cold Palace?

05:35.839 --> 05:36.839
He has not.

05:39.079 --> 05:41.800
It seems His Majesty's
favor was only fleeting.

05:42.000 --> 05:44.079
Poor Shen Zhinian, so young,

05:44.079 --> 05:45.500
yet she's already in the Cold Palace.

05:46.360 --> 05:47.800
A face as lovely as a flower,

05:48.120 --> 05:50.279
yet it cannot
withstand the ravaging wind.

05:52.439 --> 05:53.720
Before sunset today,

05:53.839 --> 05:55.120
finish washing all these clothes.

05:55.199 --> 05:55.879
Doing laundry?

05:55.879 --> 05:57.690
Isn't that
the Palace Laundry Service's job?

05:57.720 --> 05:58.780
Senior Attendant Liu said

05:59.000 --> 06:00.600
Shen Zhinian must wash them herself.

06:00.800 --> 06:02.000
No one is allowed to help her.

06:04.240 --> 06:06.120
We have never even offended Liu Ruyan.

06:06.120 --> 06:08.060
Why does she keep framing us
over and over again?

06:08.079 --> 06:10.690
Now that we are in the Cold Palace,
she still bullies us like this.

06:10.959 --> 06:13.040
Getting angry will only hurt yourself.

06:13.279 --> 06:14.319
We'll find a way

06:14.319 --> 06:16.319
to make them stop bringing clothes here.

06:16.920 --> 06:17.600
Handan,

06:17.839 --> 06:19.279
go chop some withered branches,

06:19.600 --> 06:21.879
then bring me the itch-grass
we picked the other day.

06:23.750 --> 06:24.910
You're so clever, Young Lady.

06:24.920 --> 06:25.879
I'll go right now.

06:47.040 --> 06:47.720
Young Lady,

06:47.720 --> 06:49.639
after Liu Ruyan received
the clothes you washed,

06:49.639 --> 06:50.950
she threw them into the fire pit.

06:51.079 --> 06:52.759
The flames flared up,

06:52.800 --> 06:55.250
and the whole room was filled
with ash mixed with itch-grass.

06:55.319 --> 06:58.120
Now, her body and face
are covered in rashes.

06:59.720 --> 07:01.720
These rashes won't fade

07:01.720 --> 07:02.759
for at least ten days.

07:03.199 --> 07:04.279
During this time,

07:04.279 --> 07:05.800
she won't come to pester us.

07:06.260 --> 07:07.519
You are brilliant, Young Lady.

07:09.000 --> 07:10.879
But I still feel it's unfair for you.

07:11.120 --> 07:12.759
Everything was going so smoothly,

07:12.800 --> 07:13.720
and now,

07:13.839 --> 07:15.000
we ended up in this dump.

07:15.759 --> 07:16.639
Look at this place.

07:16.650 --> 07:19.260
Doesn't it look like our old courtyard
back at the Shen residence?

07:19.759 --> 07:21.040
I think it's better than that.

07:21.050 --> 07:23.510
At least Madam Shen isn't here
to look for trouble every day.

07:24.000 --> 07:25.270
You're so optimistic, Young Lady.

07:25.680 --> 07:26.279
It's late.

07:26.290 --> 07:27.200
Let's get some sleep.

07:30.040 --> 07:31.199
What should we do?

07:32.160 --> 07:33.560
The wind has been so strong lately.

07:33.639 --> 07:34.879
The window is completely broken.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.839
What if a wild cat gets in tonight

07:37.000 --> 07:38.319
and hurts you, Young Lady?

07:38.420 --> 07:40.319
I'm only worried
that the "wild cat" won't come.

07:41.120 --> 07:41.879
Handan,

07:42.439 --> 07:44.120
go take the itch-grass
we gathered today,

07:44.120 --> 07:44.839
chop it up,

07:45.040 --> 07:46.240
and scatter it on the window.

07:47.439 --> 07:48.240
Yes.

07:58.439 --> 08:00.079
Seven days have already passed.

08:01.079 --> 08:02.600
He actually hasn't come.

08:03.279 --> 08:04.279
It seems

08:04.319 --> 08:05.480
this time will be difficult.

08:06.319 --> 08:07.160
Young Lady,

08:07.279 --> 08:08.319
what should we do?

08:11.000 --> 08:12.480
I need to send two letters out.

08:13.319 --> 08:14.560
Who are they for, Young Lady?

08:15.759 --> 08:17.040
One

08:17.399 --> 08:18.319
is for Lu Jianglin.

08:18.519 --> 08:19.519
And the other?

08:19.920 --> 08:20.959
For Jiang Chen.

08:23.890 --> 08:24.959
You're amazing, Young Lady.

08:28.000 --> 08:29.399
I hope they'll be useful.

08:30.399 --> 08:33.080
Your Majesty, these are the letters
Shen Zhinian sent out recently.

08:34.100 --> 08:36.620
(To Lu Jianglin: Life is hard,
and my rice is almost gone)

08:38.820 --> 08:41.380
(To Lord Jiang: Grant me ten sheets of
hemp paper and a stick of pine soot ink)

08:41.919 --> 08:43.080
Asking one for rice

08:43.360 --> 08:44.480
and the other for paper.

08:45.039 --> 08:46.639
Her life in the Cold Palace

08:47.000 --> 08:48.159
is lively indeed.

09:32.440 --> 09:33.799
I thought you were quite at ease,

09:33.799 --> 09:34.600
playing both sides.

09:35.480 --> 09:36.600
Why the long face then?

09:50.660 --> 09:52.990
Shen Nanqiao and Lu Jianglin
didn't leave the palace tonight.

09:53.000 --> 09:54.639
They're staying with
Dowager Consort Liu.

09:54.919 --> 09:55.919
So let them.

09:56.240 --> 09:57.159
Why are you coughing?

09:57.279 --> 09:59.399
Your Majesty asked me
to report the situation.

10:00.840 --> 10:01.840
Go on.

10:01.850 --> 10:03.560
According to
the Dowager Consort's staff,

10:03.570 --> 10:05.890
Shen Nanqiao spent the whole way
badmouthing Shen Zhinian,

10:05.900 --> 10:07.300
praising her with faint damnation.

10:08.000 --> 10:09.320
The Dowager Consort now

10:09.320 --> 10:10.519
utterly detests Shen Zhinian.

10:13.279 --> 10:15.519
Did Lu Jianglin not
say a single word for her?

10:16.799 --> 10:17.840
Not a single word.

10:25.080 --> 10:27.000
Useless trash.

10:27.000 --> 10:31.200
(Cold Palace)

10:31.200 --> 10:31.919
Strange.

10:32.020 --> 10:33.960
Why did Shen Zhinian
write to you, Young Master?

10:34.480 --> 10:35.919
Talking about orchids and magnolias,

10:36.080 --> 10:37.519
it's all completely trivial.

10:45.480 --> 10:46.960
The answer is already before us.

10:47.600 --> 10:48.360
What is it?

10:48.879 --> 10:50.120
To lure His Majesty here.

10:51.200 --> 10:53.759
Do you mean that His Majesty
has truly fallen for her?

10:53.799 --> 10:54.840
Whether it's true or false,

10:55.240 --> 10:56.679
we'll know once we go in and see.

11:05.800 --> 11:06.790
Be careful, Young Master.

11:07.600 --> 11:08.200
Who's there?

11:18.400 --> 11:23.520
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

11:25.240 --> 11:30.480
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

11:32.120 --> 11:34.480
♪If we don't meet♪

11:34.680 --> 11:37.920
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

11:38.120 --> 11:44.640
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

11:45.000 --> 11:51.440
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

11:51.800 --> 11:58.120
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

11:58.640 --> 12:05.320
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

12:05.320 --> 12:12.200
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

12:12.440 --> 12:18.320
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

12:19.240 --> 12:25.840
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

12:26.000 --> 12:32.680
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

12:32.960 --> 12:39.400
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
